tails":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JKH1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-29T16:37:44.3066667"},{"Id":"N_H1","Name":"Natalie M. Higgins","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/N_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-14T21:11:35.4066667"},{"Id":"V_H1","Name":"Vanna Howard","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/V_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T15:49:27.37"},{"Id":"MPK1","Name":"Michael P. Kushmerek","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MPK1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-03T15:52:44.5033333"},{"Id":"DAL1","Name":"David Henry Argosky LeBoeuf","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DAL1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T14:42:08.9233333"},{"Id":"JPL1","Name":"Jack Patrick Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JPL1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-05T13:21:29.7933333"},{"Id":"BWM1","Name":"Brian W. Murray","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BWM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-29T22:53:55.2933333"},{"Id":"MRP0","Name":"Marc R. Pacheco","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MRP0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T13:53:45.06"},{"Id":"L_S1","Name":"Lindsay N. Sabadosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/L_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T11:33:24.05"},{"Id":"J_S2","Name":"Jon Santiago","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/J_S2","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T14:23:33.4566667"},{"Id":"TMS1","Name":"Thomas M. Stanley","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TMS1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-09T09:08:49.22"},{"Id":"S_G2","Name":"Steven Ultrino","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_G2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T12:44:35.9266667"},{"Id":"T_V1","Name":"Tommy Vitolo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_V1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-15T12:16:59.26"},{"Id":"SLG1","Name":"Susannah M. Whipps","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T14:18:01.3466667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2995/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Cabral of New Bedford, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2995) of Antonio F. D. Cabral and others relative to bidding for public construction contracts.  State Administration and Regulatory Oversight.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Subsection 2 of section 44D of chapter 149 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out the fifth sentence, in lines 66-67, inclusive, and inserting in place thereof the following sentence: \r\n\tAn application for a certificate of eligibility and update statements shall be a public record as defined in section 7 of chapter 4 except that financial information contained in the application shall not be a public record. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Subsection 12 of said section 44D, of said chapter 149, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out the fifth sentence, in lines 279-281, inclusive, and inserting in place thereof the following sentence: \r\n\tApplications for a certificate of eligibility and update statements shall be a public record as defined in section 7 of chapter 4 except that financial information contained in the application shall not be a public record. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}